<title>HONG KONG: Giordano requests shr trading suspension.</title>
<headline>Giordano requests shr trading suspension.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Giordano International Ltd said on Friday that it had requested a trading suspension in its shares pending an announcement.  </p>
<p>&quot;The directors have been reviewing the position of the company's business operations in China and intend to issue an announcemnt to give an account of such positions as soon as practicable in order to enable shareholders of the company and the public to appraise the position of the company,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Giordano shares fell HK$1.10, or 17.89 percent, on Thursday to close at HK$5.05.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
